const DAYS=[['Sun','الأحد'],['Mon','الاثنين'],['Tue','الثلاثاء'],['Wed','الأربعاء'],['Thu','الخميس'],['Fri','الجمعة'],['Sat','السبت']];
const PRAYER=[['11:50','12:20',['Dhuhr','الظهر']],['15:10','15:40',['Asr','العصر']]];
const hrs=()=>{ const st=S.settings; if(!st.hours) st.hours={days:[0,1,2,3,4,5,6].map(d=>({on:d<=4,from:'08:00',to:'17:00'})),prayer:true}; return st.hours; };
const vac=()=>{ const v=S.settings.vacation; return v&&v.on?v:null; };
const mins=s=>{ const [h,m]=String(s).split(':').map(Number); return h*60+(m||0); };
const ksa=ts=>new Date(ts+3*HOUR);
const vacOn=ts=>{ const v=vac(); if(!v) return false; const d=ksa(ts).toISOString().slice(0,10); return (!v.from||d>=v.from)&&(!v.to||d<=v.to); };
const isOpen=MK.isOpen=ts=>{ const H=hrs(); const d=ksa(ts); const c=H.days[d.getUTCDay()]; if(!c||!c.on) return false; const m=d.getUTCHours()*60+d.getUTCMinutes(); if(m<mins(c.from)||m>=mins(c.to)) return false; if(H.prayer&&PRAYER.some(([a,b])=>m>=mins(a)&&m<mins(b))) return false; return !vacOn(ts); };
const SLA2=2*HOUR, STEP=5*MIN;
const bizDue=MK.bizDue=(ts,ms=SLA2)=>{ let c=Math.floor(ts/STEP)*STEP, r=ms; for(let i=0;i<6000&&r>0;i++){ if(isOpen(c)) r-=STEP; c+=STEP; } return c; };
const bizLeft=(from,to)=>{ let c=Math.floor(from/STEP)*STEP, n=0; for(let i=0;i<6000&&c<to;i++){ if(isOpen(c)) n+=STEP; c+=STEP; } return n; };
const nextOpen=ts=>{ let c=Math.floor(ts/STEP)*STEP; for(let i=0;i<6000;i++){ if(isOpen(c)) return c; c+=STEP; } return ts; };
const hm=ms=>{ const m=Math.round(ms/MIN), h=Math.floor(m/60); return h?t(`${h} h ${m%60} min`,`${h} س ${m%60} د`):t(`${m} min`,`${m} د`); };
const slaTag=MK.slaTag=o=>{ const due=bizDue(o.ts); const n=now(); if(n>=due) return `<span class="clk bad">${I('alert',16)} ${t('Response time passed','انتهى وقت الرد')}</span>`;
 const open=isOpen(n); const left=bizLeft(n,due);
 return `<span class="clk${left<30*MIN?' warn':''}">${I('clock',16)} ${open?t(`${hm(left)} of store hours left to accept`,`متبقٍ ${hm(left)} من ساعات العمل للقبول`):t(`Store closed — clock paused (${hm(left)} left) · resumes ${dt(nextOpen(n),{weekday:'short',hour:'numeric',minute:'2-digit'})}`,`المتجر مغلق — المؤقت متوقف (متبقٍ ${hm(left)}) · يستأنف ${dt(nextOpen(n),{weekday:'short',hour:'numeric',minute:'2-digit'})}`)}</span>`; };
MK.hoursSum=()=>{ const H=hrs(); const on=H.days.map((d,i)=>d.on?i:-1).filter(i=>i>=0); if(!on.length) return t('Closed all week','مغلق طوال الأسبوع'); const f=H.days[on[0]]; return `${tt(DAYS[on[0]])}–${tt(DAYS[on[on.length-1]])} · ${LTR(f.from+'–'+f.to)}${H.prayer?t(' · prayer pauses',' · توقف للصلاة'):''}`; };
